n><span begin="00:11.809" end="00:12.261">ness,</span> <span begin="00:12.261" end="00:12.446">hea</span><span begin="00:12.446" end="00:12.882">ven,</span> <span begin="00:12.882" end="00:13.509">sins</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">魔力 狂热 天堂 罪恶</span></p><p begin="00:13.509" end="00:15.402" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:13.509" end="00:13.714">Saw</span> <span begin="00:13.714" end="00:13.968">you</span> <span begin="00:13.968" end="00:14.439">there</span> <span begin="00:14.439" end="00:14.622">and</span> <span begin="00:14.622" end="00:14.896">I</span> <span begin="00:14.896" end="00:15.402">thought</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">看到你站在那 我心想</span></p><p begin="00:15.402" end="00:17.855" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:15.402" end="00:15.646">"Oh</span> <span begin="00:15.646" end="00:15.949">my</span> <span begin="00:15.949" end="00:16.616">god,</span> <span begin="00:16.616" end="00:16.769">look</span> <span begin="00:16.769" end="00:16.935">at</span> <span begin="00:16.935" end="00:17.241">that</span> <span begin="00:17.241" end="00:17.431">fa</span><span begin="00:17.431" end="00:17.855">ce</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">天呐 看看那张脸</span></p><p begin="00:17.905" end="00:20.327" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:17.905" end="00:18.176">You</span> <span begin="00:18.176" end="00:18.395">look</span> <span begin="00:18.395" end="00:18.550">li</span><span begin="00:18.550" end="00:18.954">ke</span> <span begin="00:18.954" end="00:19.104">my</span> <span begin="00:19.104" end="00:19.287">next</span> <span begin="00:19.287" end="00:19.643">mis</span><span begin="00:19.643" end="00:20.327">take</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你看上去就像我下一个要犯的错误</span></p><p begin="00:20.327" end="00:24.542" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:20.327" end="00:20.639">Love's</span> <span begin="00:20.639" end="00:20.924">a</span> <span begin="00:20.924" end="00:21.246">game,</span> <span begin="00:21.555" end="00:21.740">wan</span><span begin="00:21.740" end="00:22.075">na</span> <span begin="00:22.075" end="00:24.542">play?"</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">爱情是场游戏 想来玩玩儿吗</span></p><p begin="00:24.542" end="00:28.473" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:24.542" end="00:24.895">Aye,</span> <span begin="00:26.018" end="00:26.595">new</span> <span begin="00:26.595" end="00:26.727">mon</span><span begin="00:26.727" end="00:27.193">ey,</span> <span begin="00:27.193" end="00:27.369">suit</span> <span begin="00:27.369" end="00:27.866">and</span> <span begin="00:27.866" end="00:28.473">tie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">嘿 新贵的模样 穿着西装 打着领带</span></p><p begin="00:28.473" end="00:30.666" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:28.473" end="00:28.570">I</span> <span begin="00:28.570" end="00:28.973">can</span> <span begin="00:28.973" end="00:29.235">read</span> <span begin="00:29.235" end="00:29.424">you</span> <span begin="00:29.424" end="00:29.532">li</span><span begin="00:29.532" end="00:29.645">ke</span> <span begin="00:29.645" end="00:29.762">a</span> <span begin="00:29.762" end="00:30.063">ma</span><span begin="00:30.063" end="00:30.347">ga</span><span begin="00:30.347" end="00:30.666">zine</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我可以像翻阅杂志一样看穿你</span></p><p begin="00:30.914" end="00:33.526" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:30.914" end="00:31.138">Ain't</span> <span begin="00:31.138" end="00:31.581">it</span> <span begin="00:31.581" end="00:31.727">fun</span><span begin="00:31.727" end="00:32.194">ny</span> <span begin="00:32.194" end="00:32.400">rum</span><span begin="00:32.400" end="00:32.872">ors</span> <span begin="00:32.872" end="00:33.526">fly</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">传闻到处都是 很有趣吧</span></p><p begin="00:33.526" end="00:35.636" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:33.526" end="00:33.634">And</span> <span begin="00:33.634" end="00:33.959">I</span> <span begin="00:33.959" end="00:34.256">know</span> <span begin="00:34.256" end="00:34.571">you've</span> <span begin="00:34.571" end="00:34.888">heard</span> <span begin="00:34.888" end="00:35.056">a</span><span begin="00:35.056" end="00:35.336">bout</span> <span begin="00:35.336" end="00:35.636">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我知道你听过我的大名</span></p><p begin="00:35.656" end="00:37.739" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:35.656" end="00:35.981">So</span> <span begin="00:35.981" end="00:36.578">hey,</span> <span begin="00:36.578" end="00:36.895">let's</span> <span begin="00:36.895" end="00:37.214">be</span> <span begin="00:37.214" end="00:37.739">friends</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">所以 嘿 咱们做朋友吧</span></p><p begin="00:37.779" end="00:40.357" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:37.779" end="00:37.967">And</span> <span begin="00:37.967" end="00:38.196">I'm</span> <span begin="00:38.196" end="00:38.321">dyin'</span> <span begin="00:38.321" end="00:38.477">to</span> <span begin="00:38.477" end="00:38.851">see</span> <span begin="00:38.968" end="00:39.106">how</span> <span begin="00:39.106" end="00:39.336">this</span> <span begin="00:39.336" end="00:39.669">one</span> <span begin="00:39.669" end="00:40.357">ends</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我迫不及待想看看这次怎样收场</span></p><p begin="00:40.367" end="00:42.556" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="00:40.367" end="00:40.683">Grab</span> <span begin="00:40.683" end="00:40.827">your</span> <span begin="00:40.827" end="00:41.135">pass</span><span begin="00:41.135" end="00:41.607">port</span> <span begin="00:41.607" end="00:41.907">and</span> <span begin="00:41.907" end="00:42.218">my</span> <span begin="00:42.218" end="00:42.556">hand</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">带上你的护照 牵上我的手</span></p><p begin="00:42.739" end="00:45.408" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="00:42.739" end="00:43.030">I</span> <span begin="00:43.030" end="00:43.155">can</span> <span begin="00:43.155" end="00:43.314">make</span> <span begin="00:43.314" end="00:43.491">the</span> <span begin="00:43.491" end="00:43.729">bad</span> <span begin="00:43.729" end="00:44.066">guys</span> <span begin="00:44.066" end="00:44.338">good</span> <span begin="00:44.338" end="00:44.631">for</span> <span begin="00:44.631" end="00:44.784">a</span> <span begin="00:44.784" end="00:45.028">week</span><span begin="00:45.028" end="00:45.408">end</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我可以让坏男孩变乖 哪怕只是一个周末</span></p><p begin="00:45.632" end="00:47.942" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="00:45.632" end="00:45.775">So</span> <span begin="00:45.775" end="00:45.967">it's</span> <span begin="00:45.967" end="00:46.122">gon</span><span begin="00:46.122" end="00:46.265">na</span> <span begin="00:46.265" end="00:46.435">be</span> <span begin="00:46.435" end="00:46.598">for</span><span begin="00:46.598" end="00:47.942">ever</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">所以 这段恋情到底是天长地久</span></p><p begin="00:48.157" end="00:50.653" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="00:48.157" end="00:48.315">Or</span> <span begin="00:48.315" end="00:48.436">it's</span> <span begin="00:48.436" end="00:48.527">gon</span><span begin="00:48.527" end="00:48.686">na</span> <span begin="00:48.686" end="00:49.078">go</span> <span begin="00:49.078" end="00:49.395">down</span> <span begin="00:49.395" end="00:49.674">in</span> <span begin="00:49.674" end="00:49.987">fla</span><span begin="00:49.987" end="00:50.653">mes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">还是瞬间燃烧殆尽</span></p><p begin="00:50.653" end="00:53.226" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="00:50.653" end="00:50.802">You</span> <span begin="00:50.802" end="00:50.955">can</span> <span begin="00:50.955" end="00:51.130">tell</span> <span begin="00:51.130" end="00:51.259">me</span> <span begin="00:51.259" end="00:51.420">when</span> <span begin="00:51.420" end="00:51.589">it's</span> <span begin="00:51.589" end="00:52.556">over,</span> <span begin="00:52.730" end="00:53.226">mmm</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">当一切结束时 你可以告诉我 嗯</span></p><p begin="00:53.226" end="00:55.386" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="00:53.226" end="00:53.331">If</span> <span begin="00:53.331" end="00:53.475">the</span> <span begin="00:53.475" end="00:53.770">high</span> <span begin="00:53.770" end="00:54.083">was</span> <span begin="00:54.083" end="00:54.367">worth</span> <span begin="00:54.367" end="00:54.681">the</span> <span begin="00:54.681" end="00:55.386">pain</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">如果那份欢愉值得痛苦</span></p><p begin="00:55.605" end="00:58.112" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="00:55.605" end="00:55.851">Got</span> <span begin="00:55.851" end="00:55.988">a</span> <span begin="00:55.988" end="00:56.270">long</span> <span begin="00:56.270" end="00:56.583">list</span> <span begin="00:56.583" end="00:56.887">of</span> <span begin="00:56.887" end="00:57.172">ex-</span><span begin="00:57.172" end="00:58.112">lovers</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我有一长串前任的名单</span></p><p begin="00:58.118" end="01:00.374" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="00:58.118" end="00:58.457">They'll</span> <span begin="00:58.457" end="00:58.750">tell</span> <span begin="00:58.750" end="00:58.997">you</span> <span begin="00:58.997" end="00:59.336">I'm</span> <span begin="00:59.336" end="00:59.661">in</span><span begin="00:59.661" end="01:00.374">sane</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">他们会告诉你说我是个疯子</span></p><p begin="01:00.643" end="01:03.135" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="01:00.643" end="01:00.820">'Cause</span> <span begin="01:00.820" end="01:00.961">you</span> <span begin="01:00.961" end="01:01.260">know</span> <span begin="01:01.260" end="01:01.595">I</span> <